238
00:16:02,754 --> 00:16:06,598
Every one of those precincts is
a typically Republican stronghold.

239
00:16:06,633 --> 00:16:09,016
This isn't about party affiliation.

240
00:16:09,051 --> 00:16:11,888
As the president said,
this is about security.

241
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:15,898
Now, we believe this course of action,

242
00:16:15,933 --> 00:16:18,359
the voting centers with
the added law enforcement,

243
00:16:18,394 --> 00:16:19,986
will give us everything that we need

244
00:16:20,021 --> 00:16:21,821
