of the ballot box.

245
00:16:21,856 --> 00:16:25,366
Okay, but speaking for Governor
Olmstead and maybe all of our bosses,

246
00:16:25,401 --> 00:16:26,651
how can we be sure that these measures

247
00:16:26,653 --> 00:16:29,161
