248
00:16:29,196 --> 00:16:32,366
- I.e., Democrats.
- It's a chance we have to take.

249
00:16:32,992 --> 00:16:34,492
But we don't believe
it'll play out that way.

250
00:16:34,494 --> 00:16:37,128
We're in an extremely
close race in Ohio.

251
00:16:37,163 --> 00:16:40,632
Preventing further acts of terrorism
is just about all that matters, Tanya.

252
00:16:40,667 --> 00:16:44,927
Now, I do realize with
these heightened threats

253
00:16:44,962 --> 00:16:47,764
