truly gone, Marjorie called it.

320
00:20:48,289 --> 00:20:51,000
She saw the unholy alliance you
were making with Frank Underwood.

321
00:20:52,251 --> 00:20:53,920
She called it.

322
00:21:09,769 --> 00:21:11,938
So this meeting between
our bosses today...

323
