375
00:25:01,292 --> 00:25:03,710
But I'm willing to say fuck my gut.

376
00:25:10,217 --> 00:25:14,513
Bottom line is I can help you with
this committee or I can hurt you.

377
00:25:15,847 --> 00:25:19,935
Now, I can say that I know nothing...

378
00:25:21,312 --> 00:25:24,821
